keywords:
  - artificial intelligence security
  - capture the flag
  - prompt injection
  - local large language model
  - bilingual cybersecurity training
  - RomHack 2026
abstract: >-
  JANUS is an offline bilingual AI-security capture-the-flag challenge for
  RomHack 2026. It provides three progressive levels, a browser kiosk,
  local speech support, per-session HMAC-derived flags, and an optional
  local leaderboard.
